495
00:20:29,310 --> 00:20:29,510
Right.

496
00:20:29,650 --> 00:20:30,710
It's about finding that balance.

497
00:20:30,690 --> 00:20:31,370
Exactly.

498
00:20:31,510 --> 00:20:45,120
So instead of just saying, I'm passionate about marketing, which is a bit generic, you could try something like, I'm particularly drawn to company names' innovative approach to digital marketing, especially your recent campaign using specific tactics.

499
00:20:45,140 --> 00:20:46,200
Ah, so you're being specific.

500
00:20:46,240 --> 00:20:47,720
You're showing you've done your research.

501
00:20:47,850 --> 00:20:52,880
And then you could add something like it aligns perfectly with my interest in specific area of marketing.

502
00:20:52,960 --> 00:20:53,740
So it's genuine.

503
00:20:53,860 --> 00:20:54,770
It's tailored to them.

504
00:20:55,110 --> 00:20:57,750
And it shows you're not just looking for any marketing job.

505
00:20:57,850 --> 00:20:58,090
Right.

506
00:20:58,250 --> 00:21:00,960
You're looking for this job for the right reasons.

507
00:21:00,980 --> 00:21:02,800
OK, so we're nearing the end of the interview.

508
00:21:03,420 --> 00:21:05,520
