514
00:21:26,780 --> 00:21:29,150
makes me a strong candidate for this role.

515
00:21:29,190 --> 00:21:32,280
I'm eager to contribute to your team's success.

516
00:21:32,480 --> 00:21:37,090
Okay, so it's concise, it's confident, and it reinforces your key qualifications.

517
00:21:37,110 --> 00:21:38,630
It's like a mini elevator pitch.

518
00:21:38,750 --> 00:21:39,070
Yeah.

519
00:21:39,090 --> 00:21:40,690
Reminding them why they should choose you.

520
00:21:41,710 --> 00:21:41,930
All right.

521
00:21:41,970 --> 00:21:44,890
